config-connector-extensions patch 0030: mockgcp serves IAM v3 principal access boundary policies.

For iam.gcp.hfl.dev IAMPrincipalAccessBoundaryPolicy. Written here:
mockiam/principalaccessboundarypolicies.go registers the
PrincipalAccessBoundaryPolicies gRPC server and, since mockgcp has no
generated HTTP gateway for google.iam.v3, adds the REST paths
(/v3/organizations/*/locations/*/principalAccessBoundaryPolicies, and
/v3/.../operations/*) to the mux by hand, calling the server's methods.
Create, get, list, update (with an update mask) and delete; create,
update and delete answer a finished operation. The etag is computed;
an update with a stale etag is refused. Not served:
searchPolicyBindings. Upstream candidate: yes.

